 -E01\nReview: ELIGIBLE_Y4_Y5_ONLY - Sheet header '7th & 9th Semester'\; fa
 culty electives restricted to Year 4 and Year 5.\nReview: ELECTIVE_PRACTIC
 AL_SLOT_MEANING_UNCONFIRMED - Several electives print two practical slots 
 with no group/seat column (e.g. Functional Foods 2:00-3:50 | 4:00-5:50). T
 his is either two parallel sections the department assigns a student to\, 
 or a sem7/sem9 split. No legend is printed\, so BOTH slots are materialize
 d and flagged rather than fabricating a placement. Confirm with the depart
 ment and reduce to the assigned slot.\nReview: COURSE_CODE_SCRAMBLED_IN_SO
 URCE - Molecular Biology is printed as 02-06-08-E02 on Saturday and 08-PBE
  02 on Tuesday (the latter is the Clinical program's code)\, and Pharmacog
 enomics is printed as 02-06-08-E02 (colliding with Molecular Biology). Sta
 ble slugs are used for identity\; printed codes are display-only.
END:VEVENT
